WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The first impression. The bottle and its blush-pink carton on stone in soft morning light, as a petal drifts down.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
A moment of possibility. A woman by a sheer curtain turns her head towards the light.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
The first bloom. A blush flower opens in extreme close-up, flecks of pollen catching the light.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Entering her world. Seen from behind in a white gown, she walks through a rose-covered stone arch into a sunlit garden.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Nature responds. She walks between flowering shrubs, her gown trailing as petals drift.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.210
The beauty of the moment. Close-up: she meets the camera as petals fall past.

00:34.210 --> 00:36.000
Her signature. Her hand holds the bottle at her neck.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
A world unfolds. She walks a garden path to a still reflecting pool, and the camera rises over formal gardens.

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
The fragrance in motion. The camera travels into a blush bloom towards a glowing light at its heart.

00:48.000 --> 00:54.000
The product reveal. The bottle on a polished surface among fallen petals.

00:54.000 --> 00:59.880
The final hero. The bottle and its carton among blush roses: a clean end frame.
